          "abstract": "<jats:p>&lt;div class=\"htmlview paragraph\"&gt;The engineer frequently encounters experimental data consisting of observations obtained simultaneously on two variables and is interested in studying how these variables are related. This paper describes the statistical technique of linear regression analysis which provides a method for investigating the relationship between two variables. A bivariate example is presented to illustrate the application and interpretation of the technique.&lt;/div&gt;</jats:p>",
